        "algorithm": {
          "ja": "x(1−x)を掛けて境界値を厳密に組み込むtanhネットワークを、解析的な全パラメータJacobian付きTRF最小二乗法で学習します。固定予算後の全モデルを保存し、31/63/127未知数の2次中心差分とThomas法も計算します。",
          "en": "Train a hard-boundary tanh ansatz with trust-region reflective least squares and an analytic parameter Jacobian. Retain every returned model under the fixed budget. Also solve second-order finite differences with 31, 63 and 127 unknowns using the Thomas algorithm."
