        "validation": {
          "ja": "全49列の残差Jacobianと損失勾配、空間微分を別資格段階で独立照合。解析解sin(πx)に対する独立点誤差、PDE残差、境界値、FD誤差を別に保存します。収束・精度目標の実際の真偽を残し、正常な予算終了を収束と呼びません。",
          "en": "Independently qualify all 49 residual-Jacobian columns, loss-gradient coordinates and spatial derivatives. Save off-training solution error against sin(πx), PDE residual, boundary error and finite-difference error separately. Preserve actual convergence and accuracy decisions; a normal budget return is not convergence."
