      {
        "id": "fno-periodic-heat",
        "method_ids": [
          "pinn-operators"
        ],
        "title": {
          "ja": "小型FNOの問題単位検証",
          "en": "Tiny FNO on held-out heat problems"
        },
        "summary": {
          "ja": "同じ重みで32/64点・未見関数・OODを分けて評価します。",
          "en": "Evaluate the same learned weights on 32/64-point grids, held-out functions and separate OOD inputs."
        },
        "assumptions": {
          "ja": "周期区間[0,2π)、uₜ=νuₓₓ、T=0.25。同じ関数の点を分散させず、全46問題を学習24・検証6・未見ID8・νのOOD4・周波数のOOD4に分けます。2固定seed、93実パラメータです。",
          "en": "Use periodic heat flow uₜ=νuₓₓ on [0,2π) to T=0.25. Split 46 whole problems into 24 training, 6 validation, 8 held-out ID, 4 viscosity-OOD and 4 spectrum-OOD problems. Use two fixed seeds and 93 real parameters."
        },
        "algorithm": {
          "ja": "入力(u₀,ν)を幅2へ写し、局所線形項・DCと1–4モードの複素Fourier項・tanhからなる2ブロックを適用します。L-BFGS-Bの固定予算で学習し、同じ重みをN=32/64へ転送。非線形項は各格子上で評価しdealiasingしません。",
          "en": "Lift (u₀,ν) to width two and apply two blocks containing a local linear map, real DC and complex Fourier modes 1–4, then tanh. Train with a fixed L-BFGS-B budget and evaluate the same weights at N=32 and 64. Nonlinear terms are evaluated on each native grid without dealiasing."
        },
