          "en": "Qualify all 93 real loss-gradient coordinates at two fixed finite-difference widths and compare Fourier blocks with direct DFT sums. Separate analytic heat-mode errors, grid-restriction differences and ID/OOD diagnostics. Relative error is NA when reference RMS≤10⁻¹²; zero and near-zero controls retain absolute errors."
        },
