          "en": "This comparison concerns a fixed tiny discrete operator, without arbitrary-resolution, distributional or OOD guarantees. The N=64-to-32 discrepancy includes nonlinear aliasing and is not a continuum discretization error. Optimizer convergence is distinct from normal budget termination."
